{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/62","id":5410824620,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVjVyDc8AAAABQoKhrA","html_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pull/62","diff_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pull/62.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pull/62.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/issues/62","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/62/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/62/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/issues/62/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform/statuses/ac22ff635c41e4a36603c8864af53942e22e3fcb","number":62,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(ads): match all-Arab campaigns to each eligible geography","user":{"login":"productionhome2022-hash","id":348720557,"node_id":"U_kgDOFMkNrQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348720557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash","html_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Finding\nThe unified featured-ad selector currently matches only an exact audience geography. A campaign whose approved target is `all_arab_countries` therefore fails to appear for viewers in individual supported countries.\n\nThe older advertising branch contains a broader predicate, but it also incorrectly treats an audience value of `all_arab_countries` as matching every country-specific campaign.\n\n## Fix\n- Match either the exact audience geography or the explicit campaign target `all_arab_countries`.\n- Do not treat `all_arab_countries` as a viewer location that widens country-specific campaigns.\n- Add unit regression coverage for Syria, Lebanon and the non-widening case.\n\n## Safety\nSelective two-file port only. No campaign publication, pricing, reward, finance, production Firebase or deployment changes.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-20T09:15:17Z","updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:54:07Z","closed_at":"2026-11-20T09:21:02Z","merged_at":"2026-11-20T09:21:02Z","merge_commit_sha":"ef0cd3fa7d65a2c68d9c0b8873c3c4bb5c524ac3","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"productionhome2022-hash:codex/phase1-featured-ad-geography-all-arab-2026-11-20","ref":"codex/phase1-featured-ad-geography-all-arab-2026-11-20","repo":{"id":1446343181,"node_id":"R_kgDOVjVyDQ","name":"mawda-platform","full_name":"productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform","owner":{"login":"productionhome2022-hash","id":348720557,"node_id":"U_kgDOFMkNrQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348720557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash","html_url":"https://github.com